        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard Bedford, Armin van Buuren, Above & Beyond\n- Albums: Group Therapy, Tri-state, Intense\n- Songs: Alone Tonight, Sun & Moon\n- Topics: electronic dance music, trance, vocal collaborations, IDMA nominations\n\nFacts:\n- Armin van Buuren was born on 25 December 1976.\n- Armin van Buuren is a Dutch DJ, record producer, and remixer.\n- Richard Bedford gained recognition for his vocal work in electronic dance music and trance.\n- Richard Bedford collaborated with Above & Beyond on the 2006 album Tri-state.\n- Richard Bedford collaborated with Above & Beyond on the IDMA-nominated singles Alone Tonight and Sun & Moon.\n- Richard Bedford collaborated with Above & Beyond on the 2011 album Group Therapy.\n- Richard Bedford collaborated with Armin van Buuren on the 2013 album Intense.",
